@startuml
title Provider 默认线程派发模型

skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #2563EB
  ActorBorderColor #1E40AF
  LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
  ParticipantBorderColor #2563EB
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
  ParticipantFontColor #172554
  GroupBorderColor #94A3B8
  GroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}

participant "Consumer" as Consumer
participant "Netty IO 线程" as IO
participant "AllChannelHandler" as Dispatcher
participant "Dubbo 业务线程池" as Pool
participant "HeaderExchangeHandler" as Exchange
participant "Provider Invoker" as Invoker

Consumer -> IO: 发送请求字节
IO -> IO: Codec 解出 Request
IO -> Dispatcher: received(channel, request)
Dispatcher -> Pool: execute(ChannelEventRunnable)

alt 线程池接受任务
  Pool -> Exchange: handler.received(...)
  Exchange -> Exchange: handleRequest(request)
  Exchange -> Invoker: reply / invoke
  Invoker --> Exchange: RpcResult
  Exchange --> IO: send(Response)
  IO --> Consumer: 响应字节
else 线程池拒绝双向请求
  Dispatcher --> IO: SERVER_THREADPOOL_EXHAUSTED_ERROR
  IO --> Consumer: 立即返回错误响应
end

note over IO,Pool
默认 all dispatcher 把 received、connected、
disconnected、caught 事件派发到业务线程池，
避免业务执行长期占用 Netty IO 线程。
end note
@enduml
